Z||000000||Old Lar||05-20-2001||05:26 PM||||Over 100 Fieros made the trip to Carlisle Import-Kitcar Show. And the winners are:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/CarlisleWinners_1.jpg"> <BR>Wild Thing made the trip from Alabama in his one of a kind ?<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/WildThing.jpg"> <BR>Again this year Fieros outnumbered any other car make at the show.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Field2.jpg"> <BR>Special Paint on this special rebody.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Chameleon.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Chameleonsign.jpg"> <BR>Lisa won..<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Lisa.jpg"> <BR>||||reg||1
