Z||000026||kslish||05-21-2001||07:56 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fierodave2001:<BR><B>Thanks for a shot of my car, I still can't believe I brought the camera, but no film.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Sheesh Dave, you should have said something at the hotel or at the show, I would have given you a roll or two.  I had more rolls of film than I knew what to do with (or could possibly afford to develop).   Ask around next time....most Fiero folk are always willing to help.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I just hope the pics that I did take end up coming out okay...<P>Ken S.<BR>'87GT and '86SC<BR> <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A> <BR>||||reg||1
Z||000027||ElricSI||05-21-2001||08:01 PM||||I missed most of the fun.  Since I am not a morning person and had to work all day on Friday, I arrived about Saturday at 6PM.  I pulled into that parking lot by the steak resturaunt.  There were about 25 Fieros there.  (I nearly ****  myself).<P>P.S. Has anyone else noticed that there don't seem to be that many 84's on the road anymore (other than Indy's.)<P>------------------<BR>Proud Owner of 85 GT||||reg||9
