Z||000044||grinthock||05-22-2001||11:48 AM||||Yeah I wanted to go, but it was victoria day weekend in Canada, HUGE party at the beach so we cruised on up there, a short list of what we saw.<P><BR>85GT Some kind of gold colour<P>88GT black<P>86SE Black<P>BanditBalz in his 86GT Silver Fastback<P>Grinthock (ME!) in my 87GT Fastback<P>SlammedFiero (JM) in his cool 3.1 Cav Wagon cause his other car was in the shop<P>2 - S2000's (When burnout's were attempted they were pathetic!)<P>3 - Dodge Vipers<P>1 - MR2 Spyder Yellow - we never see them in Canada you can not buy them here, so it was nice to see one live!<P>1 - Gremlin X (The guy <BR>and WAY too many Ricers!  Some guy had a fishtank in the back of a pickup even!<P><BR>IT was fun for all, a bonfire at BanditBalz's place and it was great.||||reg||1
