Z||000051||Denny||05-23-2001||10:44 AM||||I'm very happy that everyone who made it had a good time, makes all the work worth it!<P>And I'm sad for those that didn't make it, but please plan for next year.<P>It was great seeing old friends and making new ones!<P>I'm currently posting, each day, some of the over 200 pictures I have to to the MAFOA club album on Photopoint. If you want to view the album, Fieros@Carlisle 2k1, the account name is dlambert@epix.net. Check back each day since it'll take a while to post them all. We also have to organize them all once they're posted.<P>Also, I like to have your pictures in the album if you'd like to share. You will get credit for your photos. If you'd like to share, contact me @ dlambert@epix.net.<P>Thanks for coming and creating great memories!<P>-Denny Lambert||||reg||14
